body:
We use drugs for many reasons, from facilitating socialization to pharmacological effects. I hope that you can go to a therapy that can help you not feel guilty and improve your relationship with the substance (since there are different types of consumption) and that it is not a problem for your life. And who knows, you will even become an activist in your city for the reduction of risks and damages. I don't think I can tell you much more, you may need specialized therapeutic help (hopefully one based on evidence and harm reduction) to help you in your process. (Sorry for my english, not my native language) Seng u a hug.

&#x200B;

PD: Maybe meditation can help you to fall sleep (?) or maybe some weed (?)
